WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.085
The scorpion.

00:01.785 --> 00:05.477
A red heart, and a long curved tail with a sting at the end.

00:05.927 --> 00:11.574
The heart is Antares, a star so large that it would swallow the orbit of Mars.

00:12.024 --> 00:19.015
In the Greek story this is the scorpion that killed Orion, which is why the two are never in the sky together.

00:19.465 --> 00:22.999
In Hawaii the same stars are the fish hook of Maui.
